{"id":"volregger-5f0.3","title":"Implement cpp_volreg_estimate (rigid_robust)","description":"Build default 6-DOF estimator with bootstrap, robust template, multi-resolution LM, warm starts, and restart rescue.","notes":"Implemented exported cpp_volreg_estimate kernel with input validation, mask handling, robust trimmed-mean template option, per-frame MSE diagnostics, and identity transform placeholders. Remaining: LM rigid solver, warm starts, restart logic, overlap taper, and true transform estimation.\nImplemented finite-difference LM-style 6-parameter rigid optimizer, SE(3)-style rigid parameterization (tx/ty/tz/rx/ry/rz), outward warm-start traversal from reference, restart seed rescue, overlap/improvement flags, and rigid resampling with rotation support in apply path. Remaining in this task: true robust template refresh from aligned frames (currently trimmed-mean over raw frames).","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-03-02T13:01:17.548286-05:00","created_by":"bbuchsbaum","updated_at":"2026-03-02T13:39:14.382031-05:00","closed_at":"2026-03-02T13:39:14.382031-05:00","close_reason":"Closed","labels":["prd","volregger"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"volregger-5f0.3","depends_on_id":"volregger-5f0","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-03-02T13:01:17.549213-05:00","created_by":"bbuchsbaum"},{"issue_id":"volregger-5f0.3","depends_on_id":"volregger-5f0.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-03-02T13:01:23.021273-05:00","created_by":"bbuchsbaum"}]}
